t{s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the acceleration is $150\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}$ at $t=4$ seconds." 13194139534603 true] [17592186298246 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298247 13194139534603 true] [17592186298246 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534603 true] [17592186298246 1041 "field-1" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298246 1104 #edb/ref 17592186298247 13194139534603 true] [17592186298246 1110 #uuid "8a362aad-a64e-5d07-9475-787135c268ea" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298247 1034 "4" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298247 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534603 true] [17592186298247 1111 #uuid "a23b053f-ea45-5f9f-a17e-46f4418afe55" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298248 1017 #edb/ref 17592186298249 13194139534603 true] [17592186298248 1089 "q-336419" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298248 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534603 true] [17592186298248 1100 "The velocity $v$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1)+2t.$ Calculate the acceleration $a$ of the particle at time $t.$\n\n$a(t)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298248 1113 #uuid "6fa56455-2957-58d5-9aaf-f51a06829b5e" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298248 1145 "We differentiate $v(t)$ to calculate $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4\\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1)+2t) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{t+1}+2\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298250 13194139534603 true] [17592186298249 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298251 13194139534603 true] [17592186298249 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534603 true] [17592186298249 1041 "field-1" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298249 1104 #edb/ref 17592186298251 13194139534603 true] [17592186298249 1110 #uuid "4bae2bb8-441a-5bb0-b5ae-2f2f77731b65" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298250 1034 "\\frac{4}{t+1}" 13194139534603 true] [17592186298250 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534603 true] [17592186298250 1111 #uuid "f0a5c361-764b-5a8c-b304-f1074